      {
        "Id": "29a5ca3700e24a3fa3cca34b99d0b0fd",
        "Title": "What this does: Creates a sheet for every Level in the model, with a structural plan view placed on each one.\n\nBefore you run:\n\n1.Make sure the arch Levels have been copy/monitored into this project.\n2.Check the model has no existing sheets numbered SP-101 upwards. If it does, change the start number in Step 3.\n3.Check the titleblock in Step 5 is the right one for this project.\n4.Make sure the run mode at the bottom is set to Manual.",
        "DescriptionText": "",
        "IsExpanded": true,
        "WidthAdjustment": 1666.186092146556,
        "HeightAdjustment": 38.297375707597894,
        "Nodes": [
          "f4f66020a04942bb9b5259b104eb4915"
        ],
        "HasNestedGroups": false,
        "Left": -3393.144214258581,
        "Top": -2653.143620693929,
        "Width": 1746.186092146556,
        "Height": 506.2973757075979,
        "FontSize": 36.0,
        "GroupStyleId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
        "InitialTop": -2234.143620693929,
        "InitialHeight": 145.0,
        "TextblockHeight": 409.0,
        "Background": "#FFBB87C6"
      },
      {
        "Id": "f46ba6ab547145c190989c63bbb240ae",
        "Title": "How to use it: Press Run once. You'll get one sheet per Level, named after the Level, numbered SP-101, SP-102, and so on.\n\nTo change the numbering: In Step 3, edit the start number (currently 101) or the prefix (currently \"SP-\").\n\nWarning: Only run this once. Running it a second time creates duplicate views and fails on the sheet numbers, because those numbers are already taken. If a run fails partway, delete the sheets and views it made before trying again.\n\nNote: One Level in the model can't take a structural plan view, so you get 21 sheets from 22 Levels. This is expected.\r\n\r\nNext to the 101; Code Block in Step 3: Sheet numbering starts here. Change this if these numbers are already used.\n\nNext to Family Types in Step 5: \"Pick the titleblock for this project.",
        "DescriptionText": "",
        "IsExpanded": true,
        "WidthAdjustment": 1694.95829099208,
        "HeightAdjustment": 2.9345789685946784,
        "Nodes": [
          "5a2f4cb8a89b4e25aa7579ef5befbfbe"
        ],
        "HasNestedGroups": false,
        "Left": -3397.565110196286,
        "Top": -2092.5081140660386,
        "Width": 1774.95829099208,
        "Height": 772.9345789685947,
        "FontSize": 36.0,
        "GroupStyleId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
        "InitialTop": -1371.5081140660386,
        "InitialHeight": 145.0,
        "TextblockHeight": 711.0,
        "Background": "#FFBB87C6"
      },
